OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear skies
OL,6,Fand light winds to begin with.
OL,7,FWidespread mist and fog forming across
OL,8,Feastern counties to start with but
OL,9,Fspreading as far as north Cornwall by
OL,10,Fthe morning. Chillier than of late.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud clear,
OL,13,Flingering in prone spots, but another
OL,14,Fdry day with sunny spells and patchy
OL,15,Fcloud to follow. Winds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
