OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAnother
OL,6,Ffoggy start on Sunday, but a cloudier
OL,7,Fday after it clears. Cloud clearing
OL,8,FMonday morning, with dry and sunny
OL,9,Fspells following through Tuesday.
OL,10,FLight winds throughout.
